     "kind": "kal_vachomer",
     "status": "blocked",
     "gloss_en": "its mother, not forbidden with it in mating, is forbidden with it in cooking; a cow and a ewe, forbidden with it in mating -- is it not right that they be forbidden with it in cooking?"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_b1_para_verachel",
     "gloss_en": "baraita: 'in its mother's milk' -- I have only its mother's milk; a cow's and a ewe's milk, from where? ... the verse says 'in its mother's milk'"
    }
   ]
  },
